The LLM generated a comprehensive test file 'sorround_test.cpp' that implements multiple tests verifying the Sorround strategy's correctness: adjacency checks, coverage of all cells exactly once, and matching an expected traversal order for a 3x3 grid. It introduced logging for these tests. In main.cpp, it extended the program to instantiate Sorround strategy objects for both clockwise and counter-clockwise traversal modes, executing them with logging, and choosing the best result based on scoring. The CMakeLists.txt was updated to include a new 'sorround_test' executable target along with appropriate source files and include directories.